{"id":"623724","name":"金针菇木耳拌虾仁","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/623724/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冰鲜虾解冻。","img":"images/623724/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去头，去虾线，洗净切小段。","img":"images/623724/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅底适量水烧开，金针菇放入，焯熟捞出过凉。","img":"images/623724/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把虾仁也焯熟，捞出。","img":"images/623724/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洗一下，虾肉更Q弹。","img":"images/623724/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"泡发焯过水的木耳。","img":"images/623724/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香菜，小米椒。","img":"images/623724/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"金针菇，木耳，虾仁放盘子里。","img":"images/623724/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放上香菜小米椒。","img":"images/623724/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，香油，米醋，辣椒红油。","img":"images/623724/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋上即可。","img":"images/623724/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/623724/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}